		{
			"id": "ezNye66gtm2BUWAXt",
			"description": "Laspistol, Compact \"Hostile Environment\" Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A shortened laspistol favoured by commissars and naval officers who need a weapon that won't print under a greatcoat; several Commissar characters across Guard fiction are shown carrying a compact sidearm distinct from a trooper's full-size laspistol, though no single novel gives it a formal designation, so \"Hostile Environment Pattern\" here is a descriptive label rather than an attested in-universe name.\n\nDesign: Damage stays at the fixed laspistol anchor (3d(2) burn) — shrinking the emitter doesn't change the lasing chemistry or the focusing coil that gives it the (2) divisor, only its housing. A smaller cell drops the shot count to 20 and shortens effective range; the shorter barrel worsens Acc by 1 but improves Bulk to -1, which is the standard GURPS trade a concealable pistol makes against a full-size one.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Astra Militarum"
			],
			"tech_level": "10",
			"legality_class": "3",
