		{
			"id": "eaOJ59D6DW0z5QrS3",
			"description": "Lasgun, Mars Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Forge-produced to exacting Mechanicus ritual-specification, the Mars pattern is prized for durability and is common among Skitarii auxilia and Mechanicus-aligned regiments; codex and Forge World background repeatedly single it out as the most rugged of the mass-production lasgun patterns.\n\nDesign: Same fixed lasgun anchor (5d(2) burn) as every pattern in this family — the difference is build quality, not lasing power. Extra shielding and a reinforced housing add roughly 1.5 lb and 1 ST over the Kantrael baseline and justify the higher cost. GCS has no reliability/ malfunction stat, so the pattern's noted ruggedness is left as lore flavour rather than a mechanical bonus.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Adeptus Mechanicus"
			],
