		{
			"id": "e2vjiQO48qYwZwhzd",
			"description": "Lasgun, Lucius Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A lighter, sleeker lasgun pattern; Gaunt's Ghosts establishes the Tanith First's lasguns as this pattern, and the novels note it as reliable but less tolerant of mud and rough handling than the heavier Munitorum-standard patterns.\n\nDesign: Damage fixed at the lasgun anchor (5d(2) burn) — a slimmer frame doesn't change the lasing chamber's output. The lighter build lowers ST requirement and improves Bulk to -3 (vs. -4 for the Kantrael/Mars/ Accatran patterns), reflecting the more compact, less rugged design. Its documented fragility in mud has no GCS reliability stat to hang on, so it's recorded here as flavour only.",
