		{
			"id": "e6Z-jBNBsjnCTjmJL",
			"description": "Hot-Shot Volley Gun",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A rare, high-maintenance support weapon fielded by elite Tempestus heavy-weapon teams, firing a rapid volley of hot-shot bolts for suppressive anti-armour and anti-elite infantry work; referenced in Militarum Tempestus background material as scarce and Munitorum- restricted compared to the standard hellgun.\n\nDesign: Per-bolt damage is the hellgun anchor (6d(3) burn) unchanged, since the volley gun is simply several hellgun-grade lasing chambers fired in quick succession rather than one bigger blast. RoF 6 represents that volley of near-simultaneous pulses. It's mounted (ST 10B on a tripod or pintle) and uses Gunner (Beams) per framework.md's rule that braced/mounted heavies use the Gunner skill family rather than Beam Weapons.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Militarum Tempestus"
